         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The invasive hornet Vespa velutina nigrithorax is more susceptible to an entomopathogenic fungus than two other hymenopteran species, the wasp Vespula vulgaris and the bumblebee Bombus terrestris</rdf:li>
